  "Mather Point 到 Yavapai Point、Village 一带的 Rim Trail 都是这种带矮石墙的铺装步道。把手机架在步道边，横拍让步道斜着伸向画面深处、峡谷占右半边；上午 9–10 点光线柔、人也少。": "The Rim Trail from Mather Point to Yavapai Point and around the Village is paved and lined with low stone walls like this one. Set your phone up at the edge of the trail and shoot horizontally, with the trail running diagonally into the frame and the canyon filling the right half. Between 9 and 10 a.m. the light is soft and it's less crowded.",
