  "金妍儿": "Kim Yu-na",
  "韩国花样滑冰奥运冠军": "South Korean Olympic figure skating champion",
  "路易斯湖结冰的湖面和湖边长椅": "The frozen surface of Lake Louise and a lakeside bench",
  "配文说在路易斯湖滑冰。首图是她穿着冰鞋坐在湖边积雪里的木长椅上，戴白色毛线帽、双手托腮对镜头笑，背景是雪地、云杉林和半山云雾；后面几张是在冰面上滑冰。": "The caption says she went skating on Lake Louise. In the first photo she sits in her skates on a snowy wooden bench by the lake, in a white knit hat, chin resting in both hands, smiling at the camera. Behind her are snow, spruce forest, and mist halfway up the mountains. The rest of the photos show her skating on the ice.",
  "冬天（约 12 月到 3 月，看冰况）费尔蒙城堡酒店前的湖面会清出一块免费滑冰场，冰鞋在酒店里租。坐在湖边长椅上，拍的人站低一点往上拍，把身后的云杉和山收进来；阴天的雪景反而柔和。": "In winter (roughly December to March, depending on ice conditions), a free skating rink is cleared on the lake in front of the Fairmont Chateau Lake Louise, and you can rent skates in the hotel. Sit on a lakeside bench and have the photographer shoot from slightly below, taking in the spruce and mountains behind you. Overcast days actually make the snow look softer.",
  "只在酒店清理、维护的那块冰面上滑，别的地方（尤其入水口附近、融雪季）冰可能很薄。": "Skate only on the patch the hotel clears and maintains. Elsewhere the ice may be thin, especially near the inlet and during the spring thaw.",
  "冬天停车场也很满，早上 9 点前到或坐 Roam 公交。": "The parking lot fills in winter too. Arrive before 9 a.m. or take Roam Transit.",
  "帖子 5 月才发，但路易斯湖 5 月底到 6 月初才化冰，滑冰的照片是更早拍的；想拍同款要冬天去。": "The post went up in May, but Lake Louise doesn't thaw until late May or early June, so the skating photos were taken earlier. To get the same shot, go in winter.",
