  "纪念碑谷 The View 下方的谷底红土地，背后是东西两座手套岩": "Red earth on the valley floor below The View at Monument Valley, with the East and West Mittens behind",
  "配文自嘲“不是合成的”。他一身卡其绿、戴渔夫帽和墨镜，站在画面右下角的红土和灌木之间，左边和中间是两座手套岩和更远的方山，上半部是大片深蓝天空，红、绿、蓝三色分明。": "He jokes in the caption that it's “not photoshopped.” Dressed in khaki green with a bucket hat and sunglasses, he stands among red dirt and shrubs in the lower right corner. The two Mittens and more distant mesas fill the left and center, and a wide deep-blue sky takes up the top half, so the red, green, and blue read cleanly.",
  "从 The View 游客中心往下开 Valley Drive，或者走 Wildcat Trail（唯一能自己走的步道），都能找到以两座手套岩为背景的位置。人站在画面一角、拍全身，留大片天空；上午光照在手套岩正面，颜色最饱和。穿和红土对比强的绿色、卡其色。": "Drive down the Valley Drive from The View visitor center, or walk the Wildcat Trail (the only trail you can hike on your own), and you'll find spots with both Mittens behind you. Stand in a corner of the frame, shoot full-length, and leave plenty of sky. In the morning the sun lights the front of the Mittens and the colors are richest. Wear green or khaki to stand out against the red earth.",
  "只能在 Valley Drive 路边和 Wildcat Trail 上活动，谷里别的地方要跟纳瓦霍导游才能进。": "On your own you can only go along the Valley Drive and on the Wildcat Trail. The rest of the valley is open only with a Navajo guide.",
  "Valley Drive 是坑洼的砂土路，底盘低的租车慢慢开或者报团；夏天中午很热。": "The Valley Drive is a rutted dirt-and-sand road. In a low-clearance rental, drive slowly or take a tour. Midday in summer is very hot.",
