  "鲍威尔湖湖岸的红色砂岩前": "In front of red sandstone on the Lake Powell shoreline",
  "配文“Escape to the desert”。近景：她戴方框墨镜站在一面红色砂岩前摆姿势，岩石的纹理和颜色占满背景。": "Captioned “Escape to the desert.” A close shot: she poses in square-framed sunglasses in front of a red sandstone wall, its texture and color filling the background.",
  "从 Wahweap 或 Antelope Point 码头租船，靠到湖湾里有平缓砂岩岸的地方上岸拍；也可以开车到犹他一侧的 Lone Rock Beach，找湖边的红岩当背景。下午光线偏暖，砂岩更红。": "Rent a boat at Wahweap or Antelope Point Marina, pull into a cove with a gently sloping sandstone shore, and go ashore to shoot. Or drive to Lone Rock Beach on the Utah side and use the red rock by the water as your backdrop. Afternoon light is warmer and makes the sandstone redder.",
  "夏天中午湖边砂岩烫脚，带水鞋；船靠岸前看清水下有没有礁石。": "At midday in summer the sandstone by the lake burns bare feet, so bring water shoes. Before beaching the boat, check for rocks under the surface.",
  "Lone Rock Beach 在格伦峡谷国家休闲区里，要买休闲区门票（国家公园年卡可用），旺季周末人车很多。": "Lone Rock Beach is in Glen Canyon National Recreation Area, which charges an entrance fee (the America the Beautiful pass is accepted). Peak-season weekends are crowded with people and vehicles.",
  "黛米·摩尔": "Demi Moore",
  "美国演员，《人鬼情未了》女主角": "American actress, star of Ghost",
  "科罗拉多河漂流途中的一处支流瀑布": "A side-canyon waterfall on a Colorado River rafting trip",
  "回顾 9 月和朋友们 8 天漂流大峡谷的多图帖：首图是她站在瀑布的水帘里仰头，后面有一群人在瀑布下的合照、穿救生衣在橡皮艇上跳舞，和峡谷风景。": "A multi-photo post looking back on an 8-day September rafting trip through the Grand Canyon with friends. The first photo shows her standing under a curtain of falling water, head tipped back. The rest include a group photo beneath the falls, people dancing on the raft in life jackets, and canyon scenery.",
  "要跟商业漂流公司走科罗拉多河（3 天到 2 周），热门日期常提前一年以上订；自己组队要参加 NPS 的河道许可抽签。Deer Creek、Elves Chasm 这些支流瀑布是常见的停靠点，导游安排上岸时在水帘里拍。": "Go with a commercial rafting outfitter on the Colorado River (trips run from 3 days to 2 weeks); popular dates often book up more than a year ahead. A private trip requires entering the NPS river permit lottery. Side-canyon falls such as Deer Creek and Elves Chasm are common stops, so take the photo under the falls when your guides bring the group ashore.",
  "瀑布下的岩石很滑，听导游安排，不要自己爬到瀑布上面；在船上和水边一直穿救生衣。": "The rock beneath the falls is slippery. Follow your guides' lead and don't climb up the falls on your own. Wear your life jacket at all times on the boat and near the water.",
  "2026 年 8 月山洪后谷底的部分设施受影响，报名前看 NPS 的最新公告。": "Flash floods in August 2026 affected some facilities at the bottom of the canyon. Check the latest NPS alerts before you book.",
  "帖子没写是哪一处瀑布。": "The post doesn't say which waterfall it is.",
  "张曦雯": "Kelly Cheung",
